   ],
   "spoken": "Black wants his bishop on b7, so we play f3 first — reinforcing e4 so that when the bishop arrives it isn't hitting a loose pawn.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Pre-defend the pawn a fianchettoed bishop will target, before the bishop gets there."
