   "line": [
    "e6"
   ],
   "spoken": "A menu for the light bishop: Bd3 severs contact with d4 and invites c5; castling instead ups our control of the d-file and discourages c5 — but there's a sharper third idea.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Each bishop square trades a different concession; know what each one invites before you choose."
