   "line": [
    "Bh3"
   ],
   "spoken": "That third idea is Bh3, leaning on e6. It isn't a move we must follow up immediately — the point is that from here on White threatens a sacrifice there, and Black has to reckon with it every move.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Building pressure on a point forces the defender to spend resources on it, weakening him elsewhere."
