   "line": [
    "Nf4"
   ],
   "spoken": "Nf4 plants the knight on its ideal square, piling more pressure onto e6 — and notice we haven't castled: the king is perfectly safe in the centre while we prioritize the attack.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Don't castle on reflex; if your king is safe, keep developing the attack instead."
